                         :math:`\mathcal{U}(-\sqrt{k}, \sqrt{k})` where
                         :math:`k = \frac{groups}{C_\text{in} * \prod_{i=0}^{2}\text{kernel\_size}[i]}`
        bias (Tensor):   the learnable bias of the module of shape (out_channels). If :attr:`bias` is ``True``,
